es/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["angular","components","design-systems","documentation","html","javascript","react","react-native","stories","storybook","styleguide","svelte","testing","typescript","ui","vite","vue","web-components","webpack","workshop"],"visibility":"public","forks":9808,"open_issues":2246,"watchers":88816,"default_branch":"next","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/pulls/8260","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/8260","diff_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/8260.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/8260.patch","merged_at":"2019-10-02T11:39:01Z"},"body":"Issues: #8211 #8094 \r\n\r\n1. Dark theme renders unreadable text on the about page and \r\n2. Dark theme missing dark `<code>` style\r\n\r\n## What I did\r\n\r\nI updated the `code` styling so it displays correctly on the dark theme. This solves #8211 and #8094. \r\n\r\n## How to test\r\n\r\nExample 1 - 8211 \r\n-----------------\r\nConfigure storybook with a dark theme\r\nClick on 'About storybook' in the top-left dropdown\r\n\r\nExample 2 - 8094\r\n-----------------\r\nConfigure Storybook to use the dark theme.\r\nCreate a story using MDX and use backticks to create a code tag - `for example`\r\nView story\r\n\r\nScreenshots with updated code for referenced issues\r\n----------------------------------\r\n\r\n<img width=\"673\" alt=\"Screenshot 2019-10-01 at 17 17 00\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6873736/65981743-aa3be480-e471-11e9-8f97-728d1a021239.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"637\" alt=\"Screenshot 2019-10-01 at 17 38 07\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6873736/65982036-44039180-e472-11e9-8734-17c147856319.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/story